:''This enemy's official name is unknown.''
The '''9th Anniversary Dummy''' is an animated enemy base found in the [[Catclaw Dojo]] during the 9th Anniversary Party Event. It was added in [[Version 11.0 Update|Version 11.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = 9th Anniversary Dummy
|image = E 591 2.png
|appearance = [[Catclaw Dojo]]
|money drop = N/A
}}

==Enemy ==
This enemy base can attack Cat Units in its range with a slow attack rate. Because it is a base, it does not move, similar to the [[Sunrise Doge|Sun Doge]] and [[Ritual Drum Doge]]. All of its attacks are instant-kill, although [[Glass Cat (Rare Cat)|Glass Cat]] and [[Metal Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Metal Cat]] can survive due to having the [[Special Abilities|Metal ability]]. Like the regular [[Dummy (Enemy Base)|Dummy]], this enemy is immune to all abilities save for [[Surge Attack]]s and [[Explosion]]s.

